        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INFINITE MINEFIELD is a new variation of the classic game with an infinitely expanding playing field. Explore new areas, uncover and avoid mines on an ever-growing board. Collect bonuses that help you gain extra time and increase your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines familiar rules with dynamic gameplay featuring strategy and time management elements. A great challenge for puzzle lovers and anyone looking to try something fresh in the genre!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable controls</p></li></ul>",
